- Merge do realneho korpusu proveden na hostu (ne v kontejneru, protoze
  `batches/` je tam read-only): novy soubor
  `batches/year_2026_20260708_124949.json` (nikdy nic neprepsal) + jeden novy
  appendovany zaznam v `batches/manifest.json` (git diff: presne +8 radku, 0
