### Architektura (dvě vrstvy evaluace)

```
VRSTVA 1 — RETRIEVAL (jen vyhledávání, bez LLM)
  datasets/*.jsonl
    → scripts/run_legal_qa_benchmark.py
    → artifacts/rag_eval/legal_qa/runs/<run_name>/
       retrieval_results.jsonl, metrics.json, summary.md

VRSTVA 2 — ANSWER EVAL (deterministic no-LLM, nad frozen retrieval)
  datasets/*.jsonl + frozen retrieval_results.jsonl + gold review
    → scripts/run_legal_answer_eval.py --no-llm --require-citations
    → artifacts/rag_eval/legal_qa/answer_eval/<run_name>/
       answer_eval_results.jsonl, metrics.json, summary.md, summary.json

VRSTVA 3 — OBSERVABILITY (offline, read-only)
  answer_eval/*/summary.json
    → app/observability/eval_metrics_exporter.py :9108
    → Prometheus :9091
    → Grafana :3002  (dashboard: NALUS — Legal Answer Eval Metrics)
```

**Důležité:** Grafana a exporter ukazují **offline benchmark výsledky**, ne live RAG API / chat metriky.

