### Frozen no-LLM answer eval baselines (VRSTVA 2)

| Corpus | Output dir | Retrieval input | Gold |
|--------|------------|-----------------|------|
| ÚS | `answer_eval/usoud_no_llm_baseline/` | `runs/usoud_gold_eval/retrieval_results.jsonl` | 5 |
| NSoud | `answer_eval/nsoud_no_llm_baseline/` | `runs/nsoud_full_baseline/retrieval_results.jsonl` | 3 |
| Mixed | `answer_eval/mixed_no_llm_baseline/` | `runs/mixed_two_pass_baseline/retrieval_results.jsonl` | 2 corpus-only |

Souhrnný report: `artifacts/rag_eval/legal_qa/answer_eval_report_20260709.md`

**Interpretace answer eval metrik:**

| Metrika | Význam |
|---------|--------|
| `strict_direct_pass_rate_all` | Podíl všech otázek se `status=pass` (direct + citace) |
| `strict_direct_pass_rate_gold` | Totéž jen nad gold položkami |
| `usable_support_rate_gold` | Gold s `direct` / `partial` / `corpus_only` |
| `citation_available_rate` | Gold s dostupnou ECLI/chunk citací |
| `direct` | Strict pass — rank-1 gold ECLI + ≥67 % keyword overlap na snippetu |
| `partial` | Použitelná opora, ne plný direct pass |
| `gap` / `boilerplate_noise` | Nesmí generovat jistou odpověď |
| `corpus_only` | Jen směrování na správný korpus, bez dokumentové citace |

**Frozen výsledky (2026-07-09, `summary.json`):**

| Corpus | usable_support_rate_gold | strict_direct_pass_rate_gold | citation_rate | unsupported_risk |
|--------|--------------------------|------------------------------|---------------|------------------|
| ÚS | **1.000** | **0.200** | **1.000** | 0 |
| NSoud | **0.667** | **0.000** | **0.667** | **1** (`nsoud-qa-010` boilerplate) |
| Mixed | **1.000** | **0.000** | **0.000** (záměr) | 0 |

